1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,199
I just went upstairs for a little bit and made my matcha.
我刚上楼待了一小会儿，做了杯抹茶。

2
00:00:03,199 --> 00:00:08,959
It is so unusual that I would make a cup of matcha before my cup of coffee but it sounded so good today.
平时我很少在喝咖啡之前先喝抹茶，但今天就是特别想喝。

3
00:00:08,959 --> 00:00:11,160
So I'm going to drink this while I get ready.
所以我准备一边喝，一边收拾打扮。

4
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:14,840
My order for getting ready has always been makeup hair outfit.
我收拾自己的顺序一直都是化妆、头发、穿衣。

5
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,840
There is no debates I've tried every other order and this one is the best.
没什么可争论的，我试过其他所有顺序，觉得这个最好。

6
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:21,959
I just have to stick to it I always do this every single morning.
我就得坚持这个顺序，每天早晨都是这样。

7
00:00:21,959 --> 00:00:24,990
My hair was able to air dry a little bit since I went upstairs.
我上楼以后，头发已经自然晾干了一点。

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,519
It's still pretty wet so I am going to start my routine I just blowdried my bangs so my hair isn't too crazy.
头发还是挺湿，我要开始了；我刚吹干刘海，这样头发就没那么乱。

9
00:00:31,519 --> 00:00:36,840
But every single time I take a shower and wash my hair I always have this conversation with myself.
但每次洗澡洗头，我总要跟自己讨论一遍。

10
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:42,800
And I'm like should I wear my hair natural and like embrace the curls or should I straighten it like I usually do.
到底保持自然卷，接受自己的卷发，还是像平时一样拉直？

11
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:48,120
For the sake of today's video since I'm showing you my routine I'm going to straighten it cuz that's what I usually do.
今天为了展示我的日常流程，我会把头发拉直，因为平时就是这样做的。

12
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:53,600
Only my curly haired girls understand the struggle and the unpredictability of having curly hair.
只有卷发女生才懂这种烦恼，以及卷发有多不可预测。

13
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:58,360
Like every time my friends and family with straight hair tell me I need to wear my hair curly more often.
直发的朋友和家人总说，我应该多让头发保持卷卷的样子。

14
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:01,600
I appreciate it and I love them so much but they just don't understand.
我很感谢，也很爱他们，但他们就是不理解。

15
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:07,759
Having curly hair is so much work and I always notice every time I straighten my hair it holds up so much better throughout the day.
打理卷发要花很多功夫，我总觉得拉直后，一整天都能保持得更好。

16
00:01:07,759 --> 00:01:10,000
I'm able to like take my fingers and brush it.
我还可以直接用手指梳理头发。

17
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,800
But when I have curly hair I could leave the house and it looks so good and then as soon as I step outside it's just like a mess tangled too much.
可留卷发时，在家看着还很好，一出门就乱成一团，缠得厉害。

18
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:22,199
And a lot of the time time I regret not just straightening it so we're going to straighten it today.
很多时候我会后悔没直接拉直，所以今天还是拉直吧。

19
00:01:22,199 --> 00:01:26,879
During the summer I like to wear my hair more natural but during winter I feel like I always straighten my hair.
夏天我喜欢更自然的头发，但冬天好像总是把它拉直。

20
00:01:26,879 --> 00:01:30,280
But as I said I do makeup hair outfit so we're going to start with makeup.
但刚才说了，我的顺序是化妆、头发、穿衣，所以先开始化妆。

21
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:35,230
In prep for it I'm going to do a little bit of skin care so I always start out with a moisturizer.
化妆前我会做一点护肤，总是先用保湿霜。

22
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:43,079
This one has been my recent favorite it was actually such a good price and I really like it and it's also pink.
这个最近是我的心头好，我觉得价格很不错，而且它也是粉色的。

23
00:01:43,079 --> 00:01:45,519
I don't know if you could tell but I love the color pink.
不知道你们有没有看出来，我很爱粉色。

24
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:50,680
And then my recent addition to my skincare routine every single morning is to use sunscreen.
我最近给每天早晨的护肤流程加了一步，就是用防晒。

25
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:58,000
This is so important and I'm so glad I'm finally starting to do this every single day like I am 22 this needs to be a part of my routine.
我觉得这非常重要，很高兴终于每天都做了；我二十二岁了，觉得该把它纳入日常。

26
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:02,879
I guess this sunscreen is specifically to use under makeup so far I'm really liking it.
这款据说是专门妆前用的防晒，目前我很喜欢。

27
00:02:02,879 --> 00:02:08,560
Cuz a lot of the time the sunscreens I use just make the foundation and concealer not really stick that well.
因为很多防晒会让我觉得粉底和遮瑕不太贴得住。

28
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:17,439
So that is literally all I do for my skincare in prep for my makeup it's nothing too crazy like as I was saying last night I focus a lot more on my nighttime skincare.
这就是我的妆前护肤，没什么复杂的；像昨晚说的，我更重视晚间护肤。

29
00:02:17,439 --> 00:02:19,949
The last thing I'll do is apply a hydrating lip balm.
最后再涂一个保湿润唇膏。

30
00:02:19,959 --> 00:02:25,120
I'm just trying the summer fridays lip butter balm and I love it so far this one's in mint.
我正在试 Summer Fridays 的润唇膏，目前很喜欢，这支是薄荷味。

31
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,840
Let's get started into the makeup.
开始化妆吧。

32
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:35,079
I don't want to do like a full tutorial on my makeup routine I'm kind of just going to apply the products and quickly go through like all the steps that I do.
我不想做完整的化妆教程，只会一边用产品，一边快速介绍各个步骤。

33
00:02:35,079 --> 00:02:42,240
Honestly my makeup routine changes all the time like there isn't really any specific products that I repurchase.
说实话，我的化妆流程一直在变，没有什么固定会回购的产品。

34
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,840
I kind of just use whatever I have.
我基本就是手头有什么就用什么。

35
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:51,509
And a lot of the time I'm using drugstore makeup because I don't want to spend 50 on a foundation and drugstore makeup has worked for me for a long time.
很多时候我用开架彩妆，因为不想花五十买粉底，而且开架产品一直挺适合我。

36
00:02:51,519 --> 00:02:54,840
While I do my makeup I just like to highlight my natural features.
化妆时，我只是想突出自己原本的五官特点。

37
00:02:54,840 --> 00:03:02,400
I've been trying not to cover up my skin so much with like a thick foundation cuz I kind of want to see all my facial features underneath.
我在尽量不涂太厚的粉底盖住皮肤，因为我想看到底下原本的面部特点。

38
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:07,480
I don't really have many freckles but there's a couple spots on my nose they come out a lot more during summer.
我雀斑不多，只在鼻子上有几处，夏天会明显些。

39
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:09,270
So I don't want to like cover all that up.
所以我不想把那些全都遮住。
